        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: আরাম",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আরাম — ārām — \"comfort; ease; rest\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "লম্বা সফরের পরে বাড়িতে আরাম লাগল। lômbā sôphôrer pôre bāṛite ārām lāglô. After the long trip it felt good to be home."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আরাম (ārām) লাগা, to feel comfortable; আরামদায়ক, comfortable, is built on it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আরাম (ārām) is usually traced to Persian ārām, \"rest, quiet, ease\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
